Urban green spaces such as parks and community gardens serve primarily as recreational amenities. Their value lies in providing city residents with areas for exercise, relaxation, and social gathering, which contributes to overall quality of life.

Text 2:
Recent studies in environmental science have demonstrated that urban green spaces perform critical ecological functions beyond recreation. Research conducted in 37 European cities found that parks and gardens reduce local ambient temperatures by an average of 3.1 degrees Celsius during heat events, mitigate stormwater runoff by absorbing up to 40 percent of rainfall, and support pollinator populations essential to surrounding agricultural regions.', $lyceon_json$[{"key":"A","text":"By agreeing that recreation is the only significant function of urban green spaces"},{"key":"B","text":"By arguing that urban green spaces offer important environmental benefits that extend beyond recreational use"},{"key":"C","text":"By suggesting that recreational amenities should be removed from urban areas"},{"key":"D","text":"By claiming that European cities have fewer green spaces than other regions"}]$lyceon_json$::jsonb, 'B', NULL, E'Text 2 explicitly states that urban green spaces perform "critical ecological functions beyond recreation," citing temperature reduction, stormwater absorption, and pollinator support. This directly challenges Text 1''s characterization of green spaces as primarily recreational amenities, so the author of Text 2 would argue that environmental benefits extend well past recreational use. Agreeing that recreation is the only function contradicts Text 2''s entire argument. Text 2 never suggests removing recreational amenities from cities. Text 2 references European cities as a research site but makes no comparative claim about green space quantity across regions.', $lyceon_json${"A":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"detail_misread"},"B":{"role":"correct","error_taxonomy":null},"C":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"inference_overreach"},"D":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"evidence_mismatch"}}$lyceon_json$::jsonb, NULL, 'draft', 1, 60, false, $lyceon_json${"provenance":"Lyceon original","authored_by":"claude","authored_date":"2026-08-27"}$l